{"name": "Ballistic Brews", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every Battle is a Driving Challenge\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/b552c0d7709e9a9132b5035494a7501c.poster.avif?t=1788252369\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/b552c0d7709e9a9132b5035494a7501c.webm?t=1788252369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/b552c0d7709e9a9132b5035494a7501c.mp4?t=1788252369\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is a test of driving skill and tactical decision-making. Drift through deadly boss attacks, mow down massive swarms, manage your economy, and brew devastating builds capable of destroying everything in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Your Favorite Vehicle\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/c493f8379690ab5d29cef19863a3c8b9.poster.avif?t=1788252369\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/c493f8379690ab5d29cef19863a3c8b9.webm?t=1788252369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/c493f8379690ab5d29cef19863a3c8b9.mp4?t=1788252369\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From a lightning-fast samurai mech to a broadside battleship, every vehicle features unique passives, weapon layouts, and build possibilities. Discover wildly different strategies with every vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Brew the Perfect Build</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"260\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/a29631c39b4d496e03fe742e1ecd16ec.poster.avif?t=1788252369\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/a29631c39b4d496e03fe742e1ecd16ec.webm?t=1788252369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/a29631c39b4d496e03fe742e1ecd16ec.mp4?t=1788252369\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend your hard-earned resources wisely. Balance immediate power against long-term growth, combine powerful item synergies, and brew game-breaking vehicles capable of surviving the toughest battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skill Over Grind\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/fe2a6265ceae0cbaec5c1f49fbafb2c4.poster.avif?t=1788252369\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/fe2a6265ceae0cbaec5c1f49fbafb2c4.webm?t=1788252369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/extras/fe2a6265ceae0cbaec5c1f49fbafb2c4.mp4?t=1788252369\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump into the action immediately. Master vehicle handling, learn powerful build synergies, and conquer increasingly brutal difficulties. Unlock new vehicles, weapons, and items as you improve.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pilot <strong>15 unique vehicles</strong>, each with distinct passives that create entirely different builds.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip <strong>30+ weapons</strong> across three weapon slots to create devastating combinations.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle through <strong>5 escalating difficulties</strong>, each introducing deadlier enemies, elite variants, and tougher boss encounters.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive third-person camera</strong> built for driving\u2014with instant zoom-out whenever you need battlefield awareness.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Endgame challenge mode for veteran players.\u00a0</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover <strong>100+ balanced items</strong> designed to encourage experimentation and endless build variety.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-paced</strong> runs that finish in under 25 minutes.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Runs great on <strong>Steam Deck</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optimized for <strong>controller</strong> gaming</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Drive tanks and robots in an immersive roguelike bullet heaven. Drift, shoot, and smash through 15 waves while brewing the ultimate build to defeat brutal bosses and elite enemies.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095000/e59c598d57cd5113e525dd5d01e78f1a95b8a928/header.jpg?t=1788252369", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Bullet Heaven",